<title>USA: TSX Corp to cut staff at Texscan unit.</title>
<headline>TSX Corp to cut staff at Texscan unit.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSX Corp said on Tuesday that it would reduce its workforce at its Texscan MSI advertising insertion business in Salt Lake City to eight employees on December 30.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said TSX would post a charge against earnings because of the move, but declined to be specific about the charge and job cuts.</p>
<p>The company said it would continue operations with a reduced staff.</p>
</text>
